#         for the class ph:Plant. Each requires at least one schema:name. Copy the schema:name line of
#         ph:OrganizationShape. Messages: "A component needs a name. A component with no name is not in the
#         component master." and "A plant needs a name. A plant with no name is not in the plant master."
